fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266DCI","fragment":"\n\tGstH266DCI\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266DCI\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266DCI\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 decoding capability information.\nspecifies the number of profile_tier_level syntax\nstructures in the DCI NAL unit.\nspecifies whether dci_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 decoding capability information.\nspecifies the number of profile_tier_level syntax\nstructures in the DCI NAL unit.\nspecifies whether dci_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 decoding capability information.\nspecifies the number of profile_tier_level syntax\nstructures in the DCI NAL unit.\nspecifies whether dci_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});